Package: agriinsight
Type: Package
Title: Unified Statistical Modeling and Biometrics for Agricultural and Biological Sciences
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Paul", "Lopez", email = "paul.lopez@uc.cl", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("DeepMind", "Antigravity", role = c("ctb"))
  )
Description: Provides a unified, model-agnostic S3 interface for advanced statistical modeling in agricultural, biological, and environmental sciences. Extends the 'easystats' philosophy to specialized domains including greenhouse microclimate modeling, plant-microbe interactions (endophytes, Trichoderma, PGPB), abiotic stress kinetics (drought FTSW, salinity ion homeostasis, anthesis heat shock, combined stress), spatial field trials (P-splines), multi-environment stability (GxE), dose-response bioassays, and longitudinal repeated measures. Includes automated AI-assisted diagnostic reporting and publication-ready vector figure exports.
